        "text_b8kfyh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>You'll find rings made from repurposed graffiti, fragments of iconic landmarks, fan-favorite sports collaborations, and college campus rocks, so no two pieces ever look exactly alike.</strong> That mix of style and meaning is what makes our unique ring gifts feel right for milestones, everyday wear, and any moment in between. Browse the rest of our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"shop all jewelry\">unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to put real craft and real meaning into every piece we make. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every ring, so each one carries the history of its material and a story of opportunity wherever you go. You can read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"Read our story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"Read customer reviews\">our customer reviews</a>.</p>"
